{
  "@odata.type": "#microsoft.graph.androidWorkProfileCompliancePolicy",
  "displayName": "ICB-AND002-PersonalWorkProfile-IntegrityAndPasscode",
  "description": "Intune Compliance Baseline, Android Enterprise personally owned work profile, Android 10 and newer. Verifies Play Integrity (basic, device and strong integrity), Google Play Services, an up-to-date security provider and the Company Portal's runtime integrity, blocks rooted devices and USB debugging, requires encryption and a passcode (complexity High on Android 12 and newer), and sets the OS floor. Marks noncompliant immediately and adds the device to the retire list after 30 days. See Frameworks/Intune-Compliance-Baseline/Design/POLICY-DESIGN.md section 8.10.",
